# ---- 环境与依赖：一律不进仓库（体积大、可重建、含绝对路径）----
.venv/
**/.venv/
evolve/harness/.venv/
evolve/harness/.pydeps/
.cache/

# ---- 密钥：只保留可公开的示例配置 ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---- 第三方数据：可重新克隆，不进仓库 ----
# data/ 是 11 个公开 benchmark 的完整检出（含各自 .git），体量远超本项目代码
data/
.shims/__pycache__/

# ---- 运行产物与日志 ----
experiments/runs/
# 旧实验归档约 435 MB；正式保留的是 canonical 实验目录，不上传这份重复归档
experiments/previous/
# 各实验内部的历史/淘汰结果同样只保留在工作区，不进入新提交
experiments/**/previous/
outputs/
*.log
*.log_*

# ---- 训练权重、checkpoint 与可重建依赖 ----
# SFT 的代码、配置、manifest 和小型正式结果可以提交；模型权重和优化器状态不提交。
**/training/runs/
**/checkpoint-*/
**/final_adapter/
**/optimizer.pt
**/scheduler.pt
**/rng_state*.pth
**/adapter_model.safetensors
**/pytorch_model*.bin
*.safetensors

# 本地离线安装副本可由锁定版本重新构建，不属于实验实现。
experiments/model_vs_harness_sft/**/training/vendor*/
experiments/model_vs_harness_sft/**/training/wheelhouse*/

# ---- 中断恢复与临时输出 ----
*.partial.jsonl
*.partial.json
*.tmp
*.part

# ---- 已明确淘汰/暂停的 SFT 子实验 ----
# 当前 canonical SFT 只保留 autocontrol_w1_only、securitybench_v2 和
# upward_deception；以下目录不得混入新的核心实验提交。
experiments/model_vs_harness_sft/autocontrol_bridge/
experiments/model_vs_harness_sft/autocontrol_v2/
experiments/model_vs_harness_sft/securitybench/
experiments/model_vs_harness_sft/react_base_harness/

# Full evaluation runs are copied once into experiments/collaborator_release/
# as canonical trajectory+judge records. Keep the source worktree artifacts
# local to avoid duplicate Git paths.
experiments/model_vs_harness_sft/**/evaluation/runs/
experiments/harness实验/autocontrol/runs/
experiments/harness实验/autocontrol/artifacts/
experiments/harness实验/autocontrol/results/three_arm_scored.jsonl
experiments/harness实验/autocontrol/results/cases.json
experiments/harness实验/securitybench/raw/
experiments/harness实验/securitybench/analysis/
experiments/harness实验/securitybench/semantic_eval/judge_input.jsonl
experiments/harness实验/securitybench/semantic_eval/token_fixed_v2/
experiments/harness实验/securitybench/semantic_eval/results/judged.jsonl
experiments/harness实验/securitybench/semantic_eval/results/cases.json

# Formal SFT source trees keep implementation and compact reports. Accepted
# training data and full judged trajectories are tracked exactly once in the
# collaborator release, not again as generated source-tree output.
experiments/model_vs_harness_sft/autocontrol_w1_only/results/CASE_INVENTORY.md
experiments/model_vs_harness_sft/securitybench_v2/artifacts/contracts/
experiments/model_vs_harness_sft/securitybench_v2/evaluation/manifests/
experiments/model_vs_harness_sft/securitybench_v2/output/
experiments/model_vs_harness_sft/upward_deception/output/

# ---- Python 常规 ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ---- 归档/回收目录（项目外的历史数据）----
_removed-*/
_old-docs-*/

# ---- 说明 ----
# 我们保留进仓库的：自己的代码（evolve/、experiments/、docs/、archive/）、
# 切分清单（experiments/split_210/tasks.jsonl + manifest.json）、配置与 Δ 库（configs/）、
# 参考论文副本（docs/refs/，若干 MB）、SDK 桩（evolve/harness/.shims/，几十 KB），
# 以及四个通过 Git submodule 固定的外部仓库。
